        BE5->>BE4: ErrRefused{Wait} (the stated wait, or 5 minutes for a block)
        BE4-->>BE6: the refusal
        BE6->>BE6: sets that venue backing_off until the wait passes and sends it no requests meanwhile (FR-025), then publishes as in step 13
    end
